<view class="safe-page emergency-page">
  <view class="safe-card safe-card--hero">
    <text class="page-kicker">现实资源</text>
    <text class="page-title">先把人连接上</text>
    <text class="page-summary">这里不提供热线号码库，也不判断你是否处于危机。它只提醒：紧急时优先找能真实到场或及时回应的帮助。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="resource-list">
    <view wx:for="{{resources}}" wx:key="title" class="resource-card">
      <text class="resource-title">{{item.title}}</text>
      <text class="resource-text">{{item.text}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-section">
    <view class="warning-card">
      <text class="warning-title">使用边界</text>
      <text class="warning-text">本工具不能替代紧急服务、线下专业评估、法律判断或医疗诊断。安全风险出现时，请先停止独自处理。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="safe-primary-button bottom-action" bindtap="goGuide">查看紧急安全指引</button>
</view>
